  "description": "# 🛡️ Command Guild.\n\n👑 **Welcome to Command Guild.**\n\n⚔️This guild is created for the IMMO community. \n\n🤝 In Command Guild, everyone is equal.\n✨ Everyone is treated with respect and fairness.\n\n# 🎯 What Are the Benefits of Command Guild?.\n\n⚠️ Currently, there are not many benefits.\nBut we are actively improving and growing.\n\n📦 ***Current Requirements.***\n\n💡**No need to grind hard or stress yourself .**\n📌 **No obligation to contribute to challenges/stockpile.**\n\n✔️Just contribute items you don’t need.\n✔️Help the guild grow at your own pace.\n✔️There is no level requirement too! \n\n🎉 **During Event Time.**\n\n🕒 You don’t need to do anything for the guild.\n\nBecause:\n\n🎁 Event rewards are limited-time. We want you to fully focus on your own progress.\n\n🔮 **Future Benefits.**\n\n🚧 We are planning:\n\n⚔️**Daily Raids and Guild Hall.**🏰 \n\n✨ Once we build guild hall, we will provide even more benefits to all members.\n\n🔥 Join Command Guild and grow together!\n\n# Discord\nhttps://discord.gg/uNMBAZfjrr\n\n\n# Top Contributers\n ***This place shows people that helped us to grow faster. We thanks to them. \n(last 7 days)***\n1. Dragolyte\n2. Gunhacker\n3. This space wait for you! \n4. This space wait for you! \n5. This space wait for you! \n6. This space wait for you!",
